# Rejouer le sondage (DEV) — VS Code REST Client
# Prérequis : backend local (make dev) ; remplacer @token par un JWT Supabase d'un compte permanent.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = <JWT_SUPABASE_COMPTE_PERMANENT>

### 1. État actuel (survey_completed_at / survey_skipped_at)
# @name me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Remise à zéro du sondage (404 si ENVIRONMENT=production)
# Attendu : 200, survey_completed_at = null et survey_skipped_at = null
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Nouvelle réponse (acceptée car le sondage est déverrouillé)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acquisition_source": "instagram",
  "practice": "photographer",
  "newsletter_opt_in": true,
  "skipped": false
}

### 4. Seconde réponse : ignorée (état terminal conservé)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acquisition_source": "tiktok",
  "practice": "hiker",
  "newsletter_opt_in": false,
  "skipped": false
}

### 5. Sans Authorization -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey/reset

### 6. Payload invalide -> 422
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acquisition_source": "inconnu"
}
